      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "源氏又问右近：“这孩子相貌长得如何？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Genji asked Ukon again, \"How has the child grown in looks?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "比得上她妈妈么？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Can she compare with her mother?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "右近答道：“不一定像她妈妈，然而从小就长得很漂亮。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ukon replied, \"She does not necessarily resemble her mother, but she has been very beautiful since childhood.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "源氏说：“那好极了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Genji said, \"That is excellent.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你看同谁一样？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Who do you think she resembles?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "比起紫夫人来呢？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How does she compare with Lady Murasaki?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "右近答道：“哪里！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ukon replied, \"Oh, not at all!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "同夫人怎么好比？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How could anyone compare her with the lady?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "大臣说：“你这么说，夫人很高兴了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Minister said, \"If you say that, the lady will be very pleased.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "只要能够像我，我便放心了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As long as she can resemble me, I shall be satisfied.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02498",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "他故意装作父亲的口气。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He deliberately adopted the tone of a father.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
